The DUT has syntax errors: missing semicolon after `count <= count + 2`, and also increment by 2 instead of 1. Fix both.

Let me write the correct RTL.

module counter(input wire clk, input wire rst, output reg [3:0] count);
always @(posedge clk) begin
    if (rst) count <= 4'b0000;
    else count <= count + 1'b1;
end
endmodule

